# Generated practical outputs.
# Every practical regenerates its own outputs/ by running its entry-point
# script, so they are not committed. The two exceptions below ARE committed,
# because practical05 consumes practical04's cleaned dataset and downstream
# work consumes practical05's feature matrix:
#   practicals/practical04/outputs/clean/fastf1_laps_clean.csv
#   practicals/practical05/outputs/
# Files already tracked in git are unaffected by these rules.
practicals/practical0*/outputs/
!practicals/practical04/outputs/clean/fastf1_laps_clean.csv
!practicals/practical05/outputs/
